title: "The Man with the Golden Gun: SOLEX — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package for The Man with the Golden Gun (1974), mission
  codename SOLEX. Deterministic mission software for solar concentration
  yield, funhouse lair escape topology, and assassin duel/bounty scheduling,
  adapted to the frozen bond-api MissionProvider protocol.
